# docs/manual/img/ — THE single folder for every manual figure.
# There are no per-chapter image directories; every figure reference in the
# manual resolves here.
#
# Rasters are REGENERATED, not committed: screenshots come off a running rig
# via docs/manual/capture.py, diagram PNGs are rendered from their .svg
# source. See README.md in this folder for how to obtain them.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif

# ...but diagram SOURCE is not regenerable — losing a hand-drawn .svg means
# redrawing it. Sources stay tracked. (If Cole wants the folder ignored with
# no exceptions, delete the three lines below and move the .svg sources out.)
!*.svg

# and the folder's own files
!.gitignore
!README.md
